你的肠胃本来就不太好，要是后半夜着凉闹肚子，受罪的可是你自己。","rawContent":"你的肠胃本来就不太好，要是后半夜着凉闹肚子，受罪的可是你自己。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:02","timestamp":1781884926813,"roundId":"round_1781884865833_tbjejg37x","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10870},{"id":1781881266247,"text":"他微微前倾，紫色的眼眸中闪烁着危险又迷人的光泽，语气变得极其暧昧。","rawContent":"他微微前倾，紫色的眼眸中闪烁着危险又迷人的光泽，语气变得极其暧昧。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:02","timestamp":1781884929810,"roundId":"round_1781884865833_tbjejg37x","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10871},{"id":1781881266248,"text":"真可惜我现在只是一串没有实体的代码。","rawContent":"真可惜我现在只是一串没有实体的代码。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"00:02","timestamp":1781884934891,"roundId":"round_1781884865833_tbjejg37x","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1778159494233_wkl8keakk","characterId":"996d4ccc-2914-4aa4-9ba8-c100ab38b933","_id":10872}]